Package: com.stevenjc.ios6revival.cacheclean
Name: Clean Up System
Version: 0.2.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Settings > Clean Up System shows free space and has one Clean button that deletes crash logs, Maps tiles, the pictures shown while apps open, ad caches, saved App Store bags and installers kept from replaced apps, then says how much it cleaned.
